        "date": "2025-02-27T15:39:48Z"
      },
      "message": "Refactor: Handle Storage Permissions Based on Android API Level\n\n-   Update `Gallery`, `ReadStorage`, and `WriteStorage` permissions to be API level-aware.\n-   For `Gallery` and `ReadStorage`, only request `READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE` on Android versions lower than API 33 (Tiramisu), and remove the permission on higher versions.\n-   For `WriteStorage`, only request `WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE` on Android versions lower than API 29 (Q), and remove the permission on higher versions.\n- Corrected the missing last } in the original file.",
